  "body": "Instead of going the roundabout way of recreating inputs with other elements, CSS, and Javascript, why not just enable customization for the current inputs? It is a waste to have a range input that you have to replace with another custom component because you cannot target the element with CSS and are essentially stuck with the default browser styles.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"304\" alt=\"Screenshot 2023-02-01 at 12 12 06 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16887907/216113511-9d5a1b5c-080b-4e85-b18a-c0b886f42016.png\">\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16887907/216114875-260b5ead-12a5-4925-895f-19382262226a.png)\r\n",
